### Minecraft Modding ###
# Ignore run/ contents but NOT the run/ dir itself, so the run/mods/ placeholder
# below can be re-included (git can't re-include under a fully-excluded parent).
run/*
!**/src/**/run/
# Keep the dev mods/ dir as a placeholder (D-12: FML scans run/mods/ — later phases
# can drop dev-parity mod jars here). The jars themselves stay ignored.
!run/mods/
run/mods/*
!run/mods/.gitkeep
**/src/generated/**/.cache/
repo/
!**/src/**/repo/
